#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:1
msgid "SurrogateManager"
msgstr "SurrogateManager"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:3
msgid ""
"Where [Surrogate](surrogate.md) handles only fit/predict, "
"`SurrogateManager` coordinates model fitting and batched prediction. An "
"acquisition configured on the optimizer scores the returned predictions."
msgstr "[Surrogate](surrogate.md)がfit/predictだけを扱うのに対し、`SurrogateManager`はモデルのフィットとバッチ予測を協調させます。オプティマイザに設定した`AcquisitionFunction`が、返された予測をスコア化します。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:5
msgid ""
"`Optimizer.set_surrogate_manager()` is a separate top-level swap point "
"from `Optimizer.set_surrogate()` (a simplified version that wraps a "
"[Surrogate](surrogate.md) in `LocalSurrogateManager`)."
msgstr "`Optimizer.set_surrogate_manager()`は、`Optimizer.set_surrogate()`（[Surrogate](surrogate.md)を`LocalSurrogateManager`でラップする簡易版）とは別のトップレベル差し替え点です。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:7
msgid "SurrogateManager's role"
msgstr "SurrogateManagerの役割"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:9
msgid ""
"`SurrogateManager`'s abstract method is `predict()`; fitting and "
"generation hooks have default implementations."
msgstr "`SurrogateManager`の抽象メソッドは`predict()`です。フィットと世代フックには既定実装があります。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:11
msgid ""
"**`predict(candidates_x, archive, ctx=None, *, refit=True) -> "
"SurrogatePrediction`** (abstract): Predicts the candidates. With "
"`refit=True` (the default), the surrogate is retrained before prediction."
msgstr "**`predict(candidates_x, archive, ctx=None, *, refit=True) -> SurrogatePrediction`**（抽象メソッド）：候補を予測します。`refit=True`（既定値）の場合は、予測前にサロゲートを再学習します。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:14
msgid ""
"**`fit(archive, ctx=None) -> None`**: A no-op by default. A pre-fit hook "
"meant to be called once before a series of `predict(..., refit=False)` "
"calls, used when the archive does not change."
msgstr "**`fit(archive, ctx=None) -> None`**：既定では何もしません。アーカイブが変化しない場合に、`predict(..., refit=False)`を連続して呼び出す前に1回だけ呼ぶ事前フィット用フックです。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:17
msgid ""
"**`last_accuracy: SurrogateAccuracy | None`** (class attribute): The "
"accuracy metric computed by the most recent `fit`. Covered in detail in "
"[Surrogate accuracy evaluation and dynamic "
"switching](surrogate_switching.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`last_accuracy: SurrogateAccuracy | None`**（クラス属性）：直近の`fit`が計算した精度指標。 "
"詳細は[サロゲート精度評価と動的切り替え](surrogate_switching.md)で扱います。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:20
msgid ""
"**`on_generation_end(gen, archive, ctx=None)`** / "
"**`with_on_generation_end(fn)`**: An end-of-generation hook. Also "
"extensible via the same copy-and-chain approach."
msgstr ""
"**`on_generation_end(gen, archive, ctx=None)`** / "
"**`with_on_generation_end(fn)`**：世代末フック。 同じくコピー＋チェーン方式で拡張できます。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:23
msgid "Built-in SurrogateManagers"
msgstr "組み込みSurrogateManager"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "Approach"
msgstr "方式"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "`GlobalSurrogateManager`"
msgstr "`GlobalSurrogateManager`"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid ""
"Fits globally once over the entire archive and predicts every candidate "
"at once"
msgstr "アーカイブ全体で1回グローバルにフィットし、全候補を一括予測する"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "`LocalSurrogateManager`"
msgstr "`LocalSurrogateManager`"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "Fits locally per candidate, using its k nearest neighbors"
msgstr "候補ごとにk近傍でローカルフィット"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "`CompositeSurrogateManager`"
msgstr "`CompositeSurrogateManager`"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "Combines named prediction channels"
msgstr "名前付きの予測チャンネルを組み合わせる"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "`PairwiseSurrogateManager`"
msgstr "`PairwiseSurrogateManager`"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md
msgid "Predicts win rates with a pairwise-comparison surrogate"
msgstr "ペア比較サロゲートで勝率を予測する"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:32
msgid ""
"`GlobalSurrogateManager(surrogate, training_set=None, "
"accuracy_evaluator=None)` uses `ArchiveObjectiveSet()` when "
"`training_set` is omitted."
msgstr ""
"`GlobalSurrogateManager(surrogate, training_set=None, "
"accuracy_evaluator=None)`は、`training_set`省略時に`ArchiveObjectiveSet()`が使われます。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:34
msgid ""
"`LocalSurrogateManager(surrogate, training_set=None, "
"accuracy_evaluator=None)` uses `KNNObjectiveSet(n_neighbors=50)` when "
"`training_set` is omitted. `n_neighbors` isn't a constructor argument of "
"`LocalSurrogateManager` itself — it's a parameter of the default "
"`training_set`. Because it reuses and refits the same `surrogate` "
"instance across candidates, it isn't thread-safe."
msgstr ""
"`LocalSurrogateManager(surrogate, training_set=None, "
"accuracy_evaluator=None)`は、`training_set`省略時に`KNNObjectiveSet(n_neighbors=50)`が使われます。"
" "
"`n_neighbors`は`LocalSurrogateManager`自体のコンストラクタ引数ではなく、既定の`training_set`が持つパラメータです。"
" 候補間で同一の`surrogate`インスタンスを使い回して再フィットする実装のため、スレッドセーフではありません。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:38
msgid ""
"`CompositeSurrogateManager(managers)` calls each named manager's "
"`predict()` and returns a multi-channel `SurrogatePrediction`. Use "
"`CompositeAcquisition` to evaluate one acquisition per channel and "
"combine the resulting score arrays with `product_combine` or "
"`rank_weighted_combine(weights=None)`."
msgstr "`CompositeSurrogateManager(managers)`は各名前付きマネージャーの`predict()`を呼び出し、複数チャンネルの`SurrogatePrediction`を返します。`CompositeAcquisition`を使うとチャンネルごとに取得関数を評価し、結果のスコア配列を`product_combine`または`rank_weighted_combine(weights=None)`で組み合わせられます。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:41
msgid ""
"`PairwiseSurrogateManager(surrogate, training_set=None, n_ref=10)` uses "
"`PairwiseComparisonSet()` when `training_set` is omitted."
msgstr ""
"`PairwiseSurrogateManager(surrogate, training_set=None, "
"n_ref=10)`は、`training_set`省略時に`PairwiseComparisonSet()`が使われます。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:43
msgid ""
"See [TrainingSet](training_set.md) and [Surrogate accuracy evaluation and"
" dynamic switching](surrogate_switching.md), respectively, for details on"
" each manager's `training_set`/`accuracy_evaluator` arguments."
msgstr "各マネージャーの`training_set`/`accuracy_evaluator`引数の詳細は、それぞれ[TrainingSet](training_set.md)と[サロゲート精度評価と動的切り替え](surrogate_switching.md)を参照してください。"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:45
msgid "Archive-based acquisitions"
msgstr "アーカイブベースの取得関数"

#: ../../components/surrogate_manager.md:47
msgid ""
"These acquisitions score candidate geometry directly against the archive "
"and do not require a surrogate prediction."
msgstr "これらの取得関数は候補の幾何学的な特徴をアーカイブと直接比較してスコア化するため、サロゲートの予測を必要としません。"

